"The Grace of the Mists hides a dimensional map room off its library."
"Years later, teleporting is banned during a Questor war fought in Ostren's wilds."
"Years later, six ships hunt the Heirs of Gemore at sea, two of them Sangrad men-of-war."
"Years later, Sarah shoots a Sangrad ship from 100-200 miles off, killing its captain and mage."
"Years later, Stella can gate across continents, and Sarah can teleport across mountains."
